    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nDNG are delighted to present No. 17 O'Rourke Park to the market, a wonderful opportunity to acquire a three-bedroom family home in one of Sallynoggin's most established and sought-after residential locations. Tucked away in a quiet cul-de-sac setting, this attractive property enjoys an enviable position within easy reach of a wealth of local amenities, excellent schools, shops and superb transport links.\n\nNo. 17 has been lovingly maintained over the years and offers bright, well-proportioned accommodation throughout. While the property would benefit from some modernisation, it provides the discerning purchaser with an excellent opportunity to create a superb family home tailored to their own tastes and requirements.\n\nExtending to 80sqm, The accommodation briefly comprises an entrance hallway, spacious living room, dining room, kitchen, three generous bedrooms, a family bathroom and seperate WC. The property further benefits from generous front and rear gardens, offering excellent potential to extend and reconfigure the existing accommodation, subject to the necessary planning permission.\n\nThe private rear garden provides a wonderful outdoor space, ideal for family enjoyment, while the substantial site offers obvious scope for future expansion. To the front, the property benefits from ample off-street parking and a generous front garden, further enhancing the appeal of this fine home.\n\nProperties in O'Rourke Park rarely come to the market and No. 17 represents a fantastic opportunity for first-time buyers, growing families and those seeking to establish themselves in a prime South County Dublin location.\n\nViewing comes highly recommended.\n\nFeatures:\n\n• Three-bedroom semi-detached family home\n• Quiet cul-de-sac setting in a highly sought-after location\n• Bright and well-proportioned accommodation throughout\n• Generous front and private rear gardens\n• Ample off-street parking to the front\n• Excellent potential to extend and reconfigure (subject to planning permission)\n• Well maintained throughout with scope for modernisation\n• Within easy reach of a host of local amenities\n• Excellent transport links including DART, LUAS and Dublin Bus services nearby\n• Close to a selection of highly regarded primary and secondary schools\n• Gas-fired central heating\n• Superb opportunity to create a dream family home in a prime South County Dublin location"
      },
